      "content": "here is the text for section 4.2: [Section 4.2: Price Adjustment Periods. The Supplier reserves the right to implement a surcharge of up to 5% on the base fuel rate during peak demand months (June-August) to account for market volatility. Such adjustments shall be applied automatically to all scheduled deliveries during said months without requiring additional written consent from SwiftRoute.]\n\njust let me know—are we safe from any sudden cost spikes in there?",
